  "articleBody": "While some DIY projects are fun, marble tile installation often crosses into 'better leave it to the pros' territory, especially if you want a perfect, lasting result. You should definitely consider calling in an expert if you’re planning on large-format marble tiles; they're heavier and more challenging to handle, and mistakes are really visible. Showers and other wet areas are another big one – proper waterproofing and installation techniques are critical to prevent leaks and damage down the road. If you're dreaming of complex patterns or designs, a professional can execute those intricate layouts flawlessly. And really, any time you're unsure about the right setting materials, how to prepare the subfloor, or how to protect against staining and etching, a professional's expertise is invaluable. Marble is a premium material, and installation errors can be costly and difficult to fix. Bringing in HH Remodeling LLC ensures that your marble tile project is handled with the care and precision it deserves.",
